<title>USA: Ansan names Shalson president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Ansan names Shalson president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH SAN FRANCISCO, Calif. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ansan Pharmaceuticals Inc Tuesday said it named Vaughan Shalson to the post of president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said Shalson assumed his responsibilities effective February 15. Shalson succeeds Mark Moran, who is leaving the company to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Shalson, 51, was most recently president and chief executive officer of Molecular Devices Corp.</p>
